'''Northgate Tower''' is an abandoned guard tower located near the crossroads between the [[Greymane Wall]], [[Ruins of Greyshire|Greyshire]] and [[Ravenshire]] in [[Gilneas]]. It is currently overrun by worgen of the Nighthowl pack.

